WEBVTT

01:41.740 --> 01:49.020
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.420 --> 01:51.960
[Episode 24]

02:20.310 --> 02:21.150
It's alright.

02:22.090 --> 02:23.490
It doesn't hurt anymore.

02:23.750 --> 02:24.560
Look.

02:24.910 --> 02:26.030
I can walk fast.

02:27.870 --> 02:30.270
Jiang Yubai, thanks for your premium care.

02:32.910 --> 02:34.510
I can finally walk by myself.

02:40.310 --> 02:42.190
Bone injuries take a long time to heal.

02:42.190 --> 02:43.360
Don't push yourself.

02:43.360 --> 02:44.590
You need to fully recover.

02:44.590 --> 02:46.470
Don't leave a root cause of trouble
for the rest of your life.

02:46.470 --> 02:47.520
No problem.

02:47.590 --> 02:49.560
Look, it doesn't hurt at all.

02:54.400 --> 02:55.190
Alright.

02:55.960 --> 02:56.750
Then...

02:58.750 --> 03:00.080
my mission is over too.

03:01.680 --> 03:03.080
I should pack up

03:03.630 --> 03:04.890
and go back to my place.

03:16.070 --> 03:16.870
Jiang Yubai.

03:22.190 --> 03:23.000
It's quite

03:23.430 --> 03:25.910
spacious here for the two of us.

03:26.710 --> 03:29.280
And it's quite close to your workshop.

03:29.310 --> 03:30.630
How about...

03:36.560 --> 03:37.710
Actually, I also...

03:47.030 --> 03:48.120
Brother, why are you here?

03:48.120 --> 03:49.280
Might as well throw your phone away
if you're not gonna use it.

03:49.280 --> 03:51.079
You didn't reply to my messages.

03:52.290 --> 03:53.650
Why are you still here?

03:54.030 --> 03:55.710
We were just discussing

03:55.710 --> 03:58.470
whether he could stay at my place
for a few more days.

03:58.470 --> 03:59.240
Stay?

04:01.930 --> 04:04.190
Just to look after each other.

04:08.910 --> 04:09.840
You stayed here?

04:11.030 --> 04:12.290
No, Brother, I just...

04:13.000 --> 04:15.280
slept on the floor here.

04:16.600 --> 04:18.130
You slept on the floor here?

04:22.270 --> 04:23.600
What were you thinking?

04:26.070 --> 04:27.600
And what were you thinking?

04:28.480 --> 04:30.160
Didn't I tell you to message me?

04:30.160 --> 04:31.420
Where's the location?

04:32.260 --> 04:33.350
You located here?

04:34.350 --> 04:37.920
-Brother, I just want to take care of her.
-Okay, I got it.

04:38.070 --> 04:39.480
Come, thanks for looking after her
these 2 days.

04:39.480 --> 04:40.070
You should go.

04:40.070 --> 04:41.600
Brother, it's not what you think.

04:41.600 --> 04:43.750
Don't call me Brother.
I'm not your brother. Leave.

04:43.750 --> 04:44.870
It's not what you think.

04:44.870 --> 04:45.360
Leave.

04:45.360 --> 04:46.830
I asked for his help, Brother.

04:46.830 --> 04:47.870
-Wait.
-Just leave.

04:47.870 --> 04:49.630
Wait, Brother, listen to me...

04:49.680 --> 04:51.510
I'll message you, Jiang Yubai!

04:52.070 --> 04:53.680
Message? Huh?

04:57.980 --> 05:00.420
One, 2, 3, 4, 5,

05:00.800 --> 05:02.950
6, 7, 8, 9, 10,

05:02.950 --> 05:05.040
11, 12, 13, 14,

05:05.040 --> 05:06.510
15, 16, 17,

05:06.510 --> 05:07.830
18, 19.

05:17.510 --> 05:18.310
Dr. Shen,

05:18.680 --> 05:19.480
look.

05:19.600 --> 05:21.330
There are already 20 stickers,

05:21.360 --> 05:23.290
and they are all different fruits.

05:23.480 --> 05:24.480
Are there 20?

05:25.190 --> 05:26.480
Making a false report again.

05:26.480 --> 05:27.680
How is that possible?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.980
I've counted them several times.

05:30.190 --> 05:31.480
One, 2, 3, 4, 5,

05:31.510 --> 05:32.540
6, 7...

05:35.070 --> 05:35.830
I'm kidding.

05:38.190 --> 05:40.120
Dr. Shen, you've turned bad.

05:42.120 --> 05:42.920
Tell me,

05:43.870 --> 05:44.870
what is your wish?

05:49.630 --> 05:50.560
I want to go out.

06:02.360 --> 06:03.000
Shui,

06:04.180 --> 06:06.980
although you've been
very cooperative recently,

06:07.040 --> 06:08.560
your physical indicators

06:10.040 --> 06:11.070
are still not ideal.

06:11.070 --> 06:12.630
I won't go far.

06:14.830 --> 06:15.630
For one day.

06:15.950 --> 06:16.920
Just one day.

06:18.420 --> 06:20.080
I'll take my medicine on time.

06:21.000 --> 06:21.870
I just want

06:23.480 --> 06:25.190
to bask in the sun

06:26.160 --> 06:27.760
and feel the breeze outside.

06:29.480 --> 06:30.810
I want to breathe the air

06:31.160 --> 06:33.159
without the smell of disinfectant.

06:47.070 --> 06:48.070
I'll apply for it.

06:50.680 --> 06:51.480
Really?

06:52.800 --> 06:54.800
But we have to make some rules first.

06:57.040 --> 06:59.159
You must follow my arrangements
when you go out.

06:59.159 --> 07:00.600
Don't leave my sight.

07:00.830 --> 07:02.310
If you feel unwell,

07:02.360 --> 07:04.020
you must tell me immediately.

07:07.270 --> 07:08.600
If I find out you hid anything...

07:08.600 --> 07:10.530
You can punish me however you want.

07:11.800 --> 07:12.600
I promise.

07:13.040 --> 07:14.640
Even 100 rules would be fine.

07:18.060 --> 07:20.410
[DOLA FOTO] [Capture Your Beauty]

07:19.630 --> 07:21.290
I want to use this photo booth.

07:26.430 --> 07:28.190
Three, two, one.

07:53.800 --> 07:55.659
The weather is really nice today.

08:47.550 --> 08:49.390
The sun feels so comfortable.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.510
I thought

08:54.000 --> 08:55.800
when you asked me to take you out,

08:56.030 --> 08:58.090
you'd want to do something exciting.

08:59.910 --> 09:00.770
I didn't expect

09:02.790 --> 09:04.320
your wish to be so ordinary.

09:06.960 --> 09:08.020
It's not ordinary.

09:09.550 --> 09:11.680
I've dreamed of having a day like this.

09:12.000 --> 09:13.400
How could it be ordinary?

09:23.030 --> 09:23.510
Shui.

09:28.000 --> 09:29.730
About what I mentioned before,

09:30.270 --> 09:32.330
the experimental therapy abroad...

09:36.200 --> 09:37.660
Have you thought about it?

09:50.790 --> 09:52.720
The success rate of the experiment

09:52.790 --> 09:54.190
isn't high to begin with.

09:55.360 --> 09:56.960
So no matter what you choose,

09:58.120 --> 09:59.080
I understand you

09:59.840 --> 10:01.040
and will support you.

11:39.630 --> 11:40.440
Dr. Shen.

11:42.440 --> 11:43.840
I accept that treatment.

12:43.490 --> 12:47.390
[Lin Zhixia]

12:45.510 --> 12:46.570
What are you doing?

12:47.670 --> 12:53.830
[Jiang Yubai]

12:53.910 --> 13:01.170
[Read papers. What about you?]

12:57.840 --> 12:59.720
Reading papers. What about you?

13:01.170 --> 13:07.810
[Working.]

13:09.010 --> 13:10.270
Don't find it a hassle.

13:10.360 --> 13:12.530
Make sure to use
the anti-slip mat in the bathroom.

13:12.530 --> 13:14.700
Remember to heat up the milk
before drinking it at night.

13:14.700 --> 13:15.830
Don't drink it cold.

13:22.370 --> 13:22.900
Okay,

13:23.010 --> 13:23.550
got it.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.980
Don't stay up too late either.

13:42.680 --> 13:43.620
This weekend,

13:44.700 --> 13:45.460
are you free?

13:52.250 --> 13:52.840
Yes.

13:57.600 --> 13:59.460
Then let's hang out this weekend.

14:09.620 --> 14:11.050
Okay, it's a date.

14:17.280 --> 14:21.820
[Search Stickers] [Pinky swear]

14:21.850 --> 14:24.250
[Sending]

14:24.470 --> 14:27.410
[Okay, it's a date.]

14:35.030 --> 14:39.450
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

14:40.360 --> 14:44.270
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

14:45.890 --> 14:52.470
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer, so at a loss ♪

14:56.450 --> 15:00.810
♪ Sometimes I wonder
if I should back down ♪

15:01.790 --> 15:05.850
♪ Sudden alienation between us
is what scares me the most ♪

15:07.030 --> 15:11.380
♪ How can two hearts beat as one
and truly feel each other? ♪

15:12.200 --> 15:12.870
Xu Nuo.

15:13.390 --> 15:14.200
-Xu Nuo.
-Xu Nuo.

15:14.200 --> 15:15.600
Xu Nuo, can you open the door?

15:15.600 --> 15:16.630
Xu Nuo, open the door.

15:16.630 --> 15:17.320
Xu Nuo!

15:18.240 --> 15:19.030
What should we do?

15:19.030 --> 15:20.960
Xu Nuo, Xu Nuo, can you hear me?
Open the door.

15:20.960 --> 15:21.720
Dr. Lin.

15:22.080 --> 15:23.790
-Dr. Lin, you're here.
-Dr. Lin.

15:23.790 --> 15:25.320
I heard something happened to Xu Nuo.

15:25.320 --> 15:27.030
Senior Tan isn't at school,
so I came to check.

15:27.030 --> 15:27.790
I don't know what happened.

15:27.790 --> 15:28.870
Xu Nuo locked herself inside.

15:28.870 --> 15:30.000
She won't answer the door for anyone.

15:30.000 --> 15:30.910
Where is the key?

15:30.910 --> 15:31.600
We...

15:31.860 --> 15:33.870
we don't have Professor Wu's signature,

15:33.870 --> 15:35.330
so we didn't dare to use it.

15:36.720 --> 15:38.390
I'll take the blame if anything happens.

15:38.390 --> 15:39.750
I'll get the professor to sign later.

15:39.750 --> 15:40.720
Go get the key.

15:40.910 --> 15:41.750
Okay.

15:48.740 --> 15:50.820
Get out! All of you, get out!

15:53.390 --> 15:55.000
It's fine. You can go back first.

15:55.000 --> 15:55.930
Leave this to me.

16:16.320 --> 16:16.960
It's me.

16:22.030 --> 16:23.150
Senior Lin.

16:24.910 --> 16:26.510
I was afraid you were
under too much pressure,

16:26.510 --> 16:27.570
so I came to see you.

16:28.960 --> 16:30.440
I messed up.

16:31.910 --> 16:33.550
I completely messed up.

16:36.220 --> 16:38.930
I don't even know
if the data can be recovered.

16:39.910 --> 16:42.040
I'm definitely getting disciplined.

16:43.000 --> 16:45.960
I know exactly what I'm capable of.

16:47.000 --> 16:49.510
I can't carry such a heavy burden.

16:51.840 --> 16:54.750
Even Senior Luo Ying
would find it a bit tough.

16:55.200 --> 16:56.910
Then she went to your team.

16:56.910 --> 16:58.460
There was really no one else.

16:58.460 --> 17:01.260
So Senior Tan made me fill in temporarily.

17:02.460 --> 17:03.960
Coordinating team members.

17:03.960 --> 17:05.359
Steering the direction.

17:05.510 --> 17:06.950
Dealing with reviews.

17:07.500 --> 17:10.160
And verifying everyone's data.

17:10.160 --> 17:12.460
I really don't have that much energy.

17:13.180 --> 17:14.359
I'm so tired.

17:32.940 --> 17:33.800
Stop knocking!

17:34.600 --> 17:35.620
[School of Mathematical Sciences
Experimental Center, Qingbei University]

17:40.330 --> 17:41.730
-Senior Tan.
-What's up?

17:44.010 --> 17:46.850
Senior, neither your team nor mine

17:46.870 --> 17:49.400
has anyone who can lead
a team independently.

17:50.420 --> 17:53.350
And your project schedule
is even tighter than mine.

17:54.500 --> 17:55.290
I know.

17:56.050 --> 17:57.650
I don't need you to remind me.

17:58.010 --> 17:59.220
If there's nothing else, please leave.

17:59.220 --> 18:00.140
I need to work.

18:00.480 --> 18:01.400
I can help.

18:03.940 --> 18:04.870
What do you mean?

18:06.420 --> 18:08.920
The data processing and model construction
you're worrying about

18:08.920 --> 18:10.080
are what I'm good at.

18:10.290 --> 18:11.140
I can help.

18:18.740 --> 18:19.530
Lin Zhixia.

18:20.220 --> 18:21.820
Given my current situation,

18:21.920 --> 18:23.650
shouldn't you be the happiest?

18:25.110 --> 18:26.030
I don't need you here

18:26.030 --> 18:27.240
playing the saint.

18:27.770 --> 18:29.660
All the resources you want in the future

18:29.660 --> 18:30.740
will flow to you.

18:31.290 --> 18:32.810
Stop talking nonsense.

18:33.140 --> 18:34.540
Do you need my help or not?

18:34.900 --> 18:36.530
If you do, I'll stay and help.

18:36.530 --> 18:37.290
If not,

18:37.290 --> 18:38.490
I'll go do my own work.

18:49.420 --> 18:50.010
Yes.

18:52.500 --> 18:53.250
Half an hour.

18:53.850 --> 18:55.530
I'll go back to my team
and arrange things first.

18:55.530 --> 18:58.010
Organize all the previous data
and materials.

18:58.010 --> 18:58.940
In half an hour,

18:59.090 --> 19:01.220
I'll see you at the supercomputer lab.

19:02.850 --> 19:03.530
Let's go.

19:04.570 --> 19:05.380
See?

19:05.660 --> 19:06.740
I told you long ago

19:07.460 --> 19:09.590
she is completely different from you.

19:10.050 --> 19:11.980
Don't act as if you know her so well.

19:12.310 --> 19:16.890
[School of Mathematical Sciences
Experimental Center, Qingbei University]

19:30.460 --> 19:32.090
You've changed your hairstyle.

19:32.090 --> 19:33.350
Looks quite youthful.

19:46.460 --> 19:47.180
Peng,

19:47.660 --> 19:48.700
here is the money for this month.

19:48.700 --> 19:49.530
Count it.

19:55.500 --> 19:56.460
Not bad, kid.

19:58.050 --> 19:59.650
The amount is exactly right.

19:59.660 --> 20:00.940
And you're even early.

20:03.220 --> 20:05.250
You look like you're doing well lately.

20:05.250 --> 20:06.780
Did something good happen?

20:07.810 --> 20:09.740
Are you getting out of this misery?

20:12.290 --> 20:13.490
You're joking, Peng.

20:14.090 --> 20:15.810
I gave it to you early since I had enough.

20:15.810 --> 20:17.470
It gives us both peace of mind.

20:18.250 --> 20:20.110
Next month will be the usual time.

20:21.090 --> 20:23.090
Alright, you're straightforward,

20:23.180 --> 20:24.240
and I'm easygoing.

20:25.900 --> 20:26.630
I'm leaving.

20:33.090 --> 20:33.850
Tingting.

20:33.170 --> 20:41.620
[Star Shine Media]

20:33.980 --> 20:35.660
I watched Su Mo's variety show last night.

20:35.660 --> 20:37.250
I didn't expect him
to react so quickly on the spot.

20:37.250 --> 20:38.740
There were a few moments
I was worried would be awkward,

20:38.740 --> 20:40.160
but he saved it with just one sentence.

20:40.160 --> 20:41.550
He did okay yesterday.

20:41.790 --> 20:42.810
Congratulations, Tingting.

20:42.810 --> 20:44.120
The trailer
for "Deep Alley and Long Night"

20:44.120 --> 20:45.530
was all over my Moments last night.

20:45.530 --> 20:46.570
Everyone is looking forward to it.

20:46.570 --> 20:47.700
You have a good eye,

20:47.700 --> 20:49.570
choosing such a good project for Su Mo.

20:49.570 --> 20:52.030
I look forward to Mo outshining the leads.

20:52.250 --> 20:53.500
He can't, really.

20:53.530 --> 20:55.050
Su Mo is still a newcomer.

20:55.050 --> 20:56.980
It's better to take things
one step at a time.

20:56.980 --> 20:59.380
Thank you, everyone.
I'm treating you to milk tea today.

20:59.380 --> 21:01.910
-Thank you, Tingting!
-Thank you, Tingting!

21:06.610 --> 21:07.420
Tingting,

21:07.500 --> 21:09.180
the brand just sent 2 more contracts,

21:09.180 --> 21:10.180
specifically asking for Su Mo.

21:10.180 --> 21:11.900
I organized them
and put them on your desk.

21:11.900 --> 21:12.610
Thank you.

21:17.350 --> 21:19.720
[Department Manager's Office]

21:54.630 --> 21:57.710
[Class Break]

21:57.420 --> 21:58.090
Friends,

21:58.090 --> 21:59.550
my boy has made an achievement.

21:59.550 --> 22:01.200
Please help like and share.

22:01.270 --> 22:03.530
I've even prepared the pictures for you.

22:08.440 --> 22:09.570
Awesome, Tingting!

22:09.880 --> 22:10.980
You've worked hard too.

22:10.980 --> 22:12.770
Congratulations.
I don't know what it means,

22:12.600 --> 22:14.370
[Congratulations]

22:12.770 --> 22:13.530
but I've shared it.

22:13.530 --> 22:14.720
Congratulations.

22:14.370 --> 22:16.470
[Wow, for someone,
work comes before everything.]

22:15.480 --> 22:17.310
For someone, work comes before everything.

22:16.490 --> 22:20.370
[Congratulations, Agent Tang.]

22:17.480 --> 22:19.210
Congratulations, Agent Tang.

22:25.520 --> 22:29.150
[Duan Qiyan]

22:25.900 --> 22:27.510
Duan, you took shots at me
in the group chat.

22:27.510 --> 22:28.460
Are you jealous?

22:31.030 --> 22:31.610
What?

22:33.420 --> 22:35.530
I said you talk too much nonsense.

22:36.180 --> 22:38.650
I'm treating you to dinner tonight.

22:38.670 --> 22:40.250
I'll give you a chance
to take shots at me.

22:40.250 --> 22:40.980
How about it?

22:40.980 --> 22:42.040
You pick the place.

22:43.530 --> 22:46.000
Sure, I'll eat you out of house and home.

22:44.150 --> 22:46.380
[Well, sure, I'll eat you out of house
and home. I'll send you the location.]

22:46.090 --> 22:47.620
I'll send you the location.

23:24.290 --> 23:25.250
You have to tell me.

23:25.250 --> 23:26.850
I really want to recreate it.

23:27.500 --> 23:28.140
No.

23:29.050 --> 23:30.030
I'm not opening a noodle shop.

23:30.030 --> 23:30.850
Just tell me.

23:33.420 --> 23:35.530
Tang, why are you so late?

23:35.660 --> 23:37.750
I've been waiting so long
I'm full from drinking water.

23:37.750 --> 23:39.220
If you still didn't show up,

23:39.220 --> 23:41.350
I would have barged into your company.

23:43.380 --> 23:44.580
Let me introduce you.

23:44.660 --> 23:45.500
Yuanyuan,

23:45.740 --> 23:47.250
the owner of this shop.

23:47.380 --> 23:49.660
Tang, my childhood friend.

23:50.050 --> 23:50.850
Hello.

23:52.870 --> 23:53.580
Hello.

23:55.980 --> 23:58.510
Come and sit.
Why are you just standing there?

24:00.900 --> 24:01.660
Tang!

24:03.380 --> 24:04.540
Wait a minute!

24:04.920 --> 24:06.140
Tang!

24:06.460 --> 24:07.920
Tang, where are you going?

24:08.940 --> 24:09.810
Duan Qiyan,

24:10.050 --> 24:10.940
if you have a problem with me,

24:10.940 --> 24:12.540
you don't have to contact me.

24:12.770 --> 24:14.830
What nonsense are you talking about?

24:14.980 --> 24:16.330
Didn't you invite me out for a meal?

24:16.330 --> 24:17.180
What's wrong?

24:19.140 --> 24:20.700
The noodles you've been showing off
to me lately

24:20.700 --> 24:22.160
are from this shop, right?

24:22.250 --> 24:23.500
Yeah, what's wrong?

24:24.770 --> 24:26.250
You are really something.

24:26.570 --> 24:28.100
What exactly did I do to you?

24:28.420 --> 24:29.460
You even found an inverse function

24:29.460 --> 24:31.460
and brought her right in front of me.

24:31.570 --> 24:33.970
Enjoy the meal with your inverse function.

24:34.290 --> 24:35.090
Tang!

24:35.140 --> 24:36.470
What inverse function?

25:11.290 --> 25:12.220
Didn't coax her?

25:14.250 --> 25:15.740
What's there to coax?

25:15.900 --> 25:17.980
We've been arguing since we were kids.

25:17.980 --> 25:19.240
That's just how she is.

25:20.460 --> 25:22.010
I think in her heart,

25:22.770 --> 25:24.770
she doesn't treat you like a friend.

25:24.810 --> 25:25.900
We really are friends.

25:25.900 --> 25:27.500
We grew up together.

25:29.380 --> 25:30.180
No.

25:30.980 --> 25:32.380
Actually, in your heart,

25:32.980 --> 25:35.240
you don't treat her like a friend either.

25:41.090 --> 25:43.010
Girls need to be coaxed.

25:43.700 --> 25:45.140
If you lose her,

25:45.610 --> 25:47.070
you'll never get her back.

26:42.750 --> 26:48.810
♪ The narcissus rides the carp,
fading away in decay ♪

26:50.260 --> 26:56.360
♪ Dark‑green lurks beneath the sea,
stirring the nebulae ♪

26:51.290 --> 26:55.650
[Lin Zhixia]

26:52.310 --> 26:53.920
Jiang Yubai, I'm almost there.

26:53.920 --> 26:54.900
Me too.

26:55.460 --> 26:56.680
There are too many people here.

26:56.680 --> 26:57.510
I'm afraid I won't be able to find you.

26:57.420 --> 27:03.920
♪ Through countless nights,
you and I march onward ♪

26:59.010 --> 27:01.350
But I'm trying to move forward.

27:04.520 --> 27:11.060
♪ Probing, waking, and gathering
love gone mad ♪

27:07.460 --> 27:08.440
Then I want to see

27:08.530 --> 27:09.460
how hard you try.

27:10.530 --> 27:11.530
I'm almost there.

27:11.630 --> 27:17.340
♪ Say yes, and let the present reset ♪

27:14.660 --> 27:15.830
I think I see you.

27:18.650 --> 27:21.610
♪ Our first night, my sunset ♪

27:22.050 --> 27:25.290
♪ The whole world, just us two ♪

27:25.670 --> 27:28.850
♪ Sleepless city, rising and falling ♪

27:29.040 --> 27:32.960
♪ Breathing the faint hush of midnight ♪

27:33.520 --> 27:36.010
♪ All around, someone strikes the fire ♪

27:36.360 --> 27:40.040
♪ Lovers burn and wound one another ♪

27:40.230 --> 27:43.000
♪ Viscera and bowels ♪

27:43.220 --> 27:46.720
♪ Through every deep night ♪

27:46.890 --> 27:51.100
♪ Played upon by others ♪

27:58.450 --> 28:02.060
[Wandelong Tavern]

28:03.330 --> 28:05.220
That cafe over there is so pretty.

28:05.570 --> 28:06.420
Yeah.

28:06.740 --> 28:07.540
Very vintage.

28:11.900 --> 28:13.050
Did you collect all the debts today?

28:13.050 --> 28:13.550
Yes, I did.

28:13.550 --> 28:14.420
Tell the brothers

28:14.420 --> 28:15.880
to have a good drink tonight.

28:15.880 --> 28:16.680
Troublesome.

28:16.740 --> 28:17.270
Let's go.

28:17.570 --> 28:18.110
What's wrong?

28:18.110 --> 28:19.420
You guys have worked hard.

28:19.420 --> 28:20.880
Let's eat well—it's on me.

28:21.090 --> 28:22.350
Okay, thank you, Peng.

28:37.980 --> 28:39.750
There was a creditor just now.

28:40.500 --> 28:41.960
I didn't want any trouble.

28:42.160 --> 28:44.240
Was it the one in the black jacket?

28:42.470 --> 28:48.070
♪ Only for this lingering warmth
of the moment ♪

28:46.110 --> 28:46.790
Yes.

28:49.580 --> 28:55.380
♪ Trading souls with the night ♪

28:49.830 --> 28:50.790
He's gone.

28:52.750 --> 28:53.440
Gone?

28:56.390 --> 29:02.170
♪ Every dusk I have stolen ♪

29:03.400 --> 29:09.420
♪ Foretells a parting ♪

29:11.730 --> 29:18.130
♪ Where did the storm start brewing ♪

29:18.800 --> 29:24.380
♪ Drenching you before we knew it? ♪

29:25.190 --> 29:28.000
♪ Let me draw near to you ♪

29:25.750 --> 29:27.280
Your hair is a little messy.

29:28.680 --> 29:31.680
♪ Let me imagine you ♪

29:30.270 --> 29:31.070
It's okay.

29:32.170 --> 29:34.360
♪ Let me sink into your ♪

29:32.430 --> 29:33.030
Let's go.

29:34.800 --> 29:38.420
♪ Scattered golden glow ♪

29:39.190 --> 29:41.530
♪ Let the night blur your figure ♪

29:42.500 --> 29:45.230
♪ Yet tear myself away from you ♪

29:46.020 --> 29:48.450
♪ I can't fathom why ♪

29:49.200 --> 29:52.410
♪ I've never truly possessed you ♪

29:53.430 --> 29:56.220
♪ That blazing, radiant feeling ♪

29:56.970 --> 29:59.750
♪ Once the rain stops, clouds disperse ♪

30:00.250 --> 30:06.120
♪ Hence, time and again, I lose ♪

30:06.930 --> 30:10.060
♪ Myself ♪

30:38.470 --> 30:41.260
♪ Let the wind pass you ♪

30:41.840 --> 30:44.700
♪ Let the dream hug you ♪

30:45.240 --> 30:47.570
♪ Let my tears turn into your ♪

30:47.820 --> 30:51.390
♪ Tide sinking into your eyes ♪

30:52.060 --> 30:54.920
♪ As I told you ♪

30:55.670 --> 30:58.520
♪ I'll never respond again ♪

30:59.070 --> 31:01.620
♪ I thought I could ♪

31:02.100 --> 31:05.760
♪ Forget ♪

31:06.370 --> 31:09.320
♪ Listen to the night breeze whispering ♪

31:10.030 --> 31:12.850
♪ It says the rain ceases
and clouds disperse ♪

31:13.270 --> 31:20.670
♪ The rarest blessing in life
is a sweet dream ♪

31:21.790 --> 31:24.570
♪ That never ends ♪

31:37.750 --> 31:39.030
We're pretty busy too,

31:39.030 --> 31:40.880
and you still have to help Tan Qianche?

31:40.880 --> 31:42.640
Then what about our progress?

31:43.000 --> 31:45.350
Right. He targeted us so much before.

31:45.480 --> 31:46.960
Why should we help him now?

31:54.000 --> 31:54.880
Calm down.

31:55.440 --> 31:56.920
I've done the math on the timing.

31:56.920 --> 31:58.450
We should be fine on our end.

32:08.220 --> 32:08.950
Are you busy?

32:09.380 --> 32:10.310
I'm downstairs.

32:10.350 --> 32:11.880
I have something to tell you.

32:11.880 --> 32:12.960
Something came up.

32:13.000 --> 32:13.790
I need to go downstairs for a bit.

32:13.790 --> 32:14.850
I'll be right back.

32:20.680 --> 32:22.880
If Lin Zhixia wants to help Tan Qianche,

32:23.310 --> 32:24.770
she must have her reasons.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.320
She's not that complicated.

32:27.790 --> 32:29.750
She didn't join Tan Qianche's project
back then

32:29.750 --> 32:30.960
because Tan Qianche

32:30.960 --> 32:32.550
didn't need anyone at all.

32:33.000 --> 32:34.660
He was forming a small clique.

32:35.590 --> 32:37.390
Now that he is really in trouble,

32:37.400 --> 32:39.270
since we are all in the same department,

32:39.270 --> 32:41.470
those who can help should do their part.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.440
This isn't personal.

32:43.440 --> 32:44.840
It's for the big picture.

32:48.000 --> 32:48.720
Shuwen,

32:49.310 --> 32:50.480
when she didn't vote for you before,

32:50.480 --> 32:51.540
wasn't it the same?

32:51.950 --> 32:53.480
She's objective.

32:53.880 --> 32:56.200
That's how she is different
from Tan Qianche,

32:56.200 --> 32:57.480
and why I chose her.

32:58.270 --> 33:00.350
So we don't need to question her choices.

33:00.350 --> 33:01.880
Just focus on your own work.

33:15.830 --> 33:16.830
Why did you come?

33:19.510 --> 33:20.160
I...

33:22.030 --> 33:23.560
brought you some desserts.

33:24.270 --> 33:26.930
You can have some
when you're tired of studying.

33:30.440 --> 33:31.200
Thank you.

33:35.310 --> 33:36.110
Actually...

33:37.790 --> 33:38.590
I missed you.

33:39.790 --> 33:41.050
I missed you very much,

33:41.880 --> 33:42.960
so I came to see you.

33:45.680 --> 33:46.480
Nothing else.

33:47.480 --> 33:48.270
Go get busy.

33:57.140 --> 33:58.010
You...

33:58.350 --> 33:59.240
Then I'll go up.

34:03.270 --> 34:04.400
I'm really going up.

34:23.659 --> 34:26.190
[Runting] [Time-Customized Wedding]

34:28.790 --> 34:33.449
[Runting] [Time-Customized Wedding]

34:33.600 --> 34:35.210
[Inspiration] [Banquet Color]

34:39.540 --> 34:40.880
[Chérie Atelier]

34:41.320 --> 34:43.060
[About Style]

34:59.650 --> 35:02.650
[Watch out for the train]

35:07.630 --> 35:08.830
The door is unlocked.

35:32.670 --> 35:33.600
You've been here

35:36.230 --> 35:37.160
all these years?

35:39.000 --> 35:39.590
Yes.

35:42.690 --> 35:44.690
Although it's your first time here,

35:45.110 --> 35:47.370
I probably don't need to show you around.

35:48.670 --> 35:49.870
After all, you can see

35:50.550 --> 35:52.080
the whole place at a glance.

35:56.670 --> 35:57.400
I came here

35:58.150 --> 35:59.230
to drink with you.

36:30.030 --> 36:31.070
Time flies.

36:33.030 --> 36:33.840
Remember

36:34.760 --> 36:36.620
the first time we drank together?

36:37.000 --> 36:39.880
It was at Lin Zhixia's house
during the Spring Festival.

36:39.880 --> 36:41.540
We drank fermented rice wine,

36:43.590 --> 36:45.120
and you actually got drunk.

36:47.030 --> 36:47.800
I remember.

36:49.630 --> 36:52.160
To stop me from staying
at Lin Zhixia's place,

36:52.960 --> 36:55.220
you carried me back in the freezing cold.

36:55.960 --> 36:57.760
You have some nerve saying that.

36:57.880 --> 36:59.110
If it weren't for you,

36:59.480 --> 37:02.280
who would've slept
on the street on New Year's Eve?

37:20.360 --> 37:21.400
Do you know

37:22.630 --> 37:23.550
about Gemini?

37:27.050 --> 37:28.530
It's the most unique one

37:29.150 --> 37:30.810
among the 12 constellations.

37:31.880 --> 37:34.210
Two people guard the starry sky together.

37:36.510 --> 37:39.040
Whenever a crisis breaks out
in the universe,

37:39.070 --> 37:40.870
both of them want to step forward

37:41.230 --> 37:42.560
to guard this universe.

37:47.230 --> 37:48.630
But the tragedy is that

37:51.000 --> 37:53.200
they belong to the same constellation.

37:54.400 --> 37:56.730
Only one person can wear the sacred cloth.

37:59.400 --> 38:00.530
And the other person

38:02.920 --> 38:04.920
is destined to hide behind forever.

38:09.190 --> 38:12.320
It's precisely because the Gemini brothers
sympathize with

38:12.320 --> 38:13.720
and encourage each other

38:14.590 --> 38:15.550
that they can become

38:15.550 --> 38:17.810
the strongest warriors in the universe.

38:21.960 --> 38:22.690
Jiang Yubai.

38:26.630 --> 38:27.800
I like Lin Zhixia.

38:32.150 --> 38:32.960
I know.

38:35.670 --> 38:36.480
From the past

38:37.760 --> 38:38.620
to the present.

38:41.030 --> 38:41.840
I'll probably

38:43.880 --> 38:45.150
like her forever.

38:53.880 --> 38:56.340
But you're the one
wearing the sacred cloth.

38:59.480 --> 39:01.740
I hope you can guard this starry sky well.

39:03.960 --> 39:04.760
In this world,

39:06.230 --> 39:08.430
no one understands her better than you,

39:09.670 --> 39:12.000
and no one can protect her
better than you.

39:16.030 --> 39:17.090
Congratulations.

39:20.190 --> 39:22.120
I sincerely wish you both the best.

39:45.190 --> 39:45.690
So,

39:47.190 --> 39:48.390
you asked me out today

39:49.280 --> 39:50.440
to tell me this?

39:51.960 --> 39:52.840
Of course not.

39:56.280 --> 39:56.960
I came here

39:57.920 --> 39:59.520
to drink you under the table.

42:04.150 --> 42:05.340
When I touched him,

42:06.210 --> 42:09.130
my fingers felt a tiny static shock.

42:10.860 --> 42:12.660
My heartbeat sped up instantly.

42:13.630 --> 42:14.920
I thought I was sick.

42:16.800 --> 42:20.170
Only when the box is opened,

42:21.150 --> 42:24.010
will the state of Schrödinger's cat
be determined.

42:25.440 --> 42:27.070
But right now, I'm very sure

42:27.980 --> 42:29.640
that Schrödinger's sickness

42:30.320 --> 42:31.590
is all Jiang Yubai's fault.
